===Etymology===
From {{m|en|proprioceptor}}, from {{af|en|prōprius|gloss1=one's own|reception|lang1=la}}. Coined by neurophysiologist {{w|Charles Scott Sherrington}}, 1906.<ref>{{R:Etymonline}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˌpɹəʊ.pɹi.əʊˈsɛp.ʃən/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˌpɹoʊ.pɹi.oʊˈsɛp.ʃən/}}
* {{hyphenation|en|pro|prio|cep|tion}}

